!pdf/systemprompt-io-factsheet-airgap.pdf

# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock — for a workspace with binaries (this is one), committing the
# lockfile is the convention. It pins exact transitive versions for
# reproducible builds + makes `nix flake check` resolve. Keep tracked.

